## What I did this iteration

**Extracted the ranked-search core into `lib/memory-query.sh`** (Tasks 2, 3, 7):

- Moved `memory_ranked_search` + `_expand_domain_keywords` out of the 2268-line `sw-memory.sh` monolith into a new fail-open module, plus a new `_memory_query_keywords` helper that encapsulates the tokenize→stopword-strip→domain-expand pipeline.
